{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "命主八字庚申 甲申 己巳 壬申，日主己土以甲木正官为夫星，但月干甲木坐申金截脚，年、月、时三申伤官重重克官，夫星虚浮无根，婚姻基础薄弱。日支巳火为夫妻宫，虽与日主同根，却被三申合中带刑，暗藏情欲纠葛。2022壬寅年，流年夫星甲木得寅木强根，看似夫缘增强，然寅木入局与三申发生猛烈冲克（寅申冲），夫星根气被伤官群起而攻，更兼流年太岁引发寅巳申三刑，夫妻宫刑伤动荡，婚姻必有大灾。\n\n从原局看，伤官旺盛多主女性自身强势、感情主动，日支巳申暗合伤官，内藏私情之象。壬寅年官星得根冲击伤官，东窗事发之兆明显，故断是命主出轨被揭发。大运丙子，天干丙火印星护身护婚，但流年壬水正财冲克大运丙火，财破印，主家宅不宁、婚书受损；流年夫妻宫逢紫微斗数流年擎羊与天同化忌相冲，矛盾激化毫无回转余地，当年极难得到原谅，终至婚变分离。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P1_G0\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P1_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 130599, "response_id": "dd5e147c-cf1b-4ed2-b9ce-ba6a2bd57fc7", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 803, "completion_tokens": 7231, "total_tokens": 8034, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 6912}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 803}}
{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和情绪？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字与紫微斗数命盘综合分析：\n\n八字戊土生于丑月，土旺得时，日坐戌土强根，时柱丁巳正印生身，身强无疑。月干辛金伤官透出却得丑土库中藏金而有力，形成少见的“伤官配印”格局（年柱辛亥亦是伤官）。伤官主才智与傲气，配印则内敛沉静、善于思考，性格外圆内方。地支丑戌相刑虽藏火土之性，但全局无明火凸显，故情绪稳定，非偏激之人。\n\n紫微斗数命宫天府（旺）坐未宫，无任何煞星冲破。天府为南斗主星，性温和、厚重，善协调人际关系，有容人之量。迁移宫廉贞七杀（庙），外出表现果断有魄力，但命宫主导本性，故对外刚强对内柔和。福德宫紫微贪狼（得）见文曲科、禄存，内心世界丰富多彩，喜高雅艺术与精神享受，独处时能自得其乐。身宫在夫妻宫武曲破军，感情行动力强，但非孤僻之象。\n\n综合命格，命主善于交际却非浮夸之人，具备独处的精神涵养，符合“乐于交际又自得其乐”之象。故答案为D。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1c", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1c_R0_P1_G0\\details_2024_b1c_R0_P1_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 12975, "response_id": "71d6e59c-af18-4d04-9c78-addc1e579dbb", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 761, "completion_tokens": 775, "total_tokens": 1536, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 470}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 633}}
